{
  "name": "Users — Signature Get",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node-webhook",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        100,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "users/signature",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-validate",
      "name": "Validar Entrada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        320,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nconst assertUuid = (value, field) => {\n  const text = String(value ?? '').trim();\n  if (!/^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[1-5][0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i.test(text)) {\n    throw new Error(`Invalid ${field}: ${value}`);\n  }\n  return text;\n};\n\nconst input = $input.first().json;\nconst query = input.query ?? input;\nreturn [{ json: { user_id: assertUuid(query.user_id, 'user_id') } }];\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-lookup",
      "name": "Leer Firma",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        540,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT signature_drive_file_id,\n       signature_mimetype\nFROM public.users\nWHERE id = $1::uuid",
        "additionalFields": {
          "queryParams": "={{ [ $json.user_id ] }}"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "POSTGRES_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Postgres"
        }
      },
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "id": "node-has-signature",
      "name": "¿Tiene Firma?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        760,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-file",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.signature_drive_file_id }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-download",
      "name": "Descargar de Drive",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        980,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "download",
        "fileId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.signature_drive_file_id }}"
        },
        "options": {
          "binaryPropertyName": "data"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "GOOGLE_DRIVE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Drive"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-respond-file",
      "name": "Responder Binario",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "binary",
        "responseDataSource": "set",
        "inputFieldName": "data",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-respond-empty",
      "name": "Responder Sin Firma",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        980,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "noData",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 204
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Validar Entrada",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Validar Entrada": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Leer Firma",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Leer Firma": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "¿Tiene Firma?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "¿Tiene Firma?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Descargar de Drive",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Responder Sin Firma",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Descargar de Drive": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Responder Binario",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "notes": "CONFIGURACIÓN REQUERIDA:\n1. Credencial 'Postgres' (POSTGRES_CREDENTIAL_ID).\n2. Credencial 'Google Drive' (GOOGLE_DRIVE_CREDENTIAL_ID).\n3. Webhook CON autenticación Bearer.\n\nRUTA: GET https://<tu-n8n>/webhook/users/signature?user_id=<uuid>\n\nDevuelve el binario de la firma con su Content-Type — mismo contrato que\n/clinic/logo. El front nunca pide la URL de Drive directamente: la auth de\nDrive la resuelve n8n.\n\nRESPONSE 200: la imagen (image/png | image/jpeg | image/webp)\nRESPONSE 204: el usuario no tiene firma cargada. El front lo trata como\n              \"sin firma\" (blob vacío), no como error.\n\nREQUISITOS: database/scripts/068_20260819_prescriptions-and-doctor-signature.sql\nCONTRATO:   src/constants/routes.ts → USER_SIGNATURE\nCONSUMIDORES:\n  - src/components/users/signature-uploader.tsx (api.getBlob)\n  - src/components/medical-instructions/prescription-print-view.tsx\n    (<img src> en la receta impresa, vía getDoctorSignatureUrl)"
  }
}
